,"site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":7543296,"digest":"sha256:ac7897a938a977dfb067ab9a981e65b45de73d9dafd0fccfb0f81579e4a73546","download_count":2,"created_at":"2026-10-05T22:16:21Z","updated_at":"2026-10-05T22:16:21Z"},{"id":613745487,"node_id":"RA_kwDOM7BPMc4klQNP","name":"msb-windows-aarch64.exe","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":37062656,"digest":"sha256:73089965141c9dce375ac50c8b3201384e087cf9d50fdb14ca62a7f0793014c3","download_count":2,"created_at":"2026-10-05T22:16:21Z","updated_at":"2026-10-05T22:16:23Z"},{"id":613745493,"node_id":"RA_kwDOM7BPMc4klQNV","name":"msb-windows-x86_64.exe","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":43465216,"digest":"sha256:b9ab938dbaec901d49b52401da33cd1bcc303d9504f5492a351b1761884d1c5a","download_count":21,"created_at":"2026-10-05T22:16:21Z","updated_at":"2026-10-05T22:16:23Z"}],"body":"<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yml at v0.7.7 -->\n\n## What's Changed\n### Breaking changes\n* build(ruby)!: parallelize builds for supported ruby versions by @toksdotdev in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1728\n### Features\n* feat(network): add HTTP CONNECT outbound proxy by @m42e in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1508\n* feat(runtime): add option to disable guest clock sync by @skorfmann in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1707\n* feat(storage): add cache cleanup, usage reports, and CLI polish by @appcypher in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1637\n* feat(cli): add command tree depth and display controls by @appcypher in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1759\n* feat(filesystem): DAX support and optional init binary by @jbms in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1661\n### Fixes\n* fix(sdk): allow removing a sandbox that never started by @0xpolarzero in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1724\n* fix(network): drain TCP responses before closing by @toksdotdev in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1726\n* fix(ssh): create SFTP files and directories as the session user by @0xpolarzero in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1713\n* fix(types): give nat64_prefixes a utoipa schema by @TheRealSibasishBehera in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1729\n* fix(snapshot): regenerate image VMDK descriptor on archive import by @0xpolarzero in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1712\n* fix(runtime): update libkrunfw to Linux 6.12.111 by @toksdotdev in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1740\n* fix(sdk): report symlinked bind mount roots at create time by @0xpolarzero in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1734\n* fix(agentd): apply exec limits before switching users by @toksdotdev in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1746\n* fix(network): publish ports without host routes by @toksdotdev in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1754\n* fix(sdk): read restored resource targets while the sandbox is still starting by @0xpolarzero in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1741\n* fix(sdk): prevent secret leaks and correct adapter behavior by @appcypher in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1756\n* fix(control-client): include the peer's message in rejected operation errors by @0xpolarzero in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1757\n* fix(snapshot): accept reordered image metadata when importing an archive by @0xpolarzero in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1744\n* fix(runtime): surface guest initialization failures by @toksdotdev in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1758\n* fix(python): support secret policy modification options by @GodBlf in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1763\n* fix(network): keep earlier dns answers bound to a domain by @yapadesouci in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1747\n### Performance\n* perf(runtime): reduce paused sandbox host cpu by @appcypher in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1755\n### Dependencies\n* chore(deps): Bump the \"dependencies\" group with 2 updates across multiple ecosystems by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1718\n* chore(deps): bump the cargo group across 1 directory with 1 update by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1719\n* chore(deps): bump pageant from 0.2.1 to 0.2.2 in /sdk/ruby/ext/microsandbox in the cargo group across 1 directory by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1752\n### Build\n* build: allow deprecated fetch_update for rust 1.99 by @gregwebs in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1725\n### Maintenance\n* chore: refresh lockfiles after v0.7.6 by @github-actions[bot] in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1723\n* chore(release): bump microsandbox to 0.7.7 by @appcypher in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1760\n\n## New Contributors\n* @gregwebs made their first contribution in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1725\n* @0xpolarzero made their first contribution in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1724\n* @m42e made their first contribution in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1508\n* @GodBlf made their first contribution in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1763\n* @yapadesouci made their first contribution in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1747\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/compare/v0.7.6...v0.7.7","mentions_count":11}
